<title>USA: Partnership raises stake in Hi-Lo.</title>
<headline>Partnership raises stake in Hi-Lo.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hwang Family Ltd Partnership said Wednesday it raised its stake in Hi-Lo Automotive Inc to 824,800 common shares or 7.7 percent from 6.1 percent held previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the partnership said its latest transactions included the purchase of 170,000 common shares bought between September 4 and October 4 at prices ranging from $3.25 to $3.375 per share.</p>
</text>
